    {
      "id": "awkward",
      "name": "Awkward: Office malfunctions",
      "risk_level": 2,
      "templates": [
        {
          "id": "awkward_02",
          "text": "My Slack status has been stuck on \"{{status}}\" for weeks, and I've started to believe it.",
          "slots": {
            "status": {
              "options": [
                "In a meeting",
                "Out sick",
                "On vacation 🏖️",
                "Do not disturb",
                "Focusing"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_03",
          "text": "I physically can't stop calling my manager {{wrong_name}}. It's been going on for three months.",
          "slots": {
            "wrong_name": {
              "options": [
                "Mom",
                "Dad",
                "Your Majesty",
                "Coach",
                "babe"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_04",
          "text": "During my performance review I {{embarrassing_action}}. Lucky for me our HR is on leave.",
          "slots": {
            "embarrassing_action": {
              "options": [
                "cried a little",
                "called my manager “Mom”",
                "fell asleep",
                "ate a whole rotisserie chicken",
                "asked for a hug"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_05",
          "text": "I can only give client presentations while {{condition}}. They haven't noticed yet.",
          "slots": {
            "condition": {
              "options": [
                "standing on one leg",
                "wearing a cape",
                "eating soup",
                "holding my cat",
                "lying on the floor"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_06",
          "text": "I get terrified at the mere thought of {{fear}}.",
          "slots": {
            "fear": {
              "options": [
                "a surprise one-on-one",
                "Excel formulas",
                "the office karaoke night",
                "the CEO asking \"got a minute?\"",
                "a camera-on meeting"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_07",
          "text": "I burst into tears whenever someone mentions {{tear_trigger}}.",
          "slots": {
            "tear_trigger": {
              "options": [
                "the deadline",
                "the Q3 roadmap",
                "the movie Up",
                "my old Tamagotchi",
                "client feedback"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_08",
          "text": "At the same time each week, thoughts of {{weekly_sorrow}} leave me sobbing.",
          "slots": {
            "weekly_sorrow": {
              "options": [
                "the Sunday scaries",
                "my ex's dog",
                "the game we shipped late",
                "Friday's demo",
                "my lost youth"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_09",
          "text": "Cravings for {{craving}} keep taking over my whole routine.",
          "slots": {
            "craving": {
              "options": [
                "salty licorice",
                "chalk",
                "the office cookies",
                "ketchup on everything",
                "cold pizza"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_10",
          "text": "I keep dragging every conversation back to {{obsession}}, however hard I try not to.",
          "slots": {
            "obsession": {
              "options": [
                "my CrossFit routine",
                "the Roman Empire",
                "my cat's diet",
                "my ex",
                "the time I met a celebrity"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_11",
          "text": "Even during important conversations, I lose all focus at the sight of {{distraction}}.",
          "slots": {
            "distraction": {
              "options": [
                "a dog outside the window",
                "the CEO's mustache",
                "a crooked picture frame",
                "a snack on someone's desk",
                "a stain on someone's shirt"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_12",
          "text": "Since turning forty, my body plays the Windows shutdown sound whenever I {{action}}.",
          "slots": {
            "action": {
              "options": [
                "bend over",
                "climb stairs",
                "sneeze",
                "sit on the floor",
                "open a jar"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_13",
          "text": "I keep seeing {{vision}} whenever I shut my eyes.",
          "slots": {
            "vision": {
              "options": [
                "falling Tetris blocks",
                "my manager's face",
                "a loading spinner",
                "the spreadsheet I just closed",
                "the dancing hot dog"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_14",
          "text": "My work is never finished; whenever a deadline approaches, I turn into {{transformation}}.",
          "slots": {
            "transformation": {
              "options": [
                "a gremlin",
                "a raccoon in a hoodie",
                "my father",
                "a feral cat",
                "a motivational speaker"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_15",
          "text": "I keep getting into trouble for {{misdeed}}, but then I do it again.",
          "slots": {
            "misdeed": {
              "options": [
                "replying-all",
                "stealing pens",
                "napping in meeting rooms",
                "eating other people's lunch",
                "playing music without headphones"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_16",
          "text": "I keep arriving late because I get caught up in {{rabbit_hole}}.",
          "slots": {
            "rabbit_hole": {
              "options": [
                "Wikipedia rabbit holes",
                "petting every dog",
                "arguing with strangers online",
                "reorganizing my sock drawer",
                "a staring contest with a seagull"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_17",
          "text": "I cannot begin my day until I have spent fifteen minutes on {{ritual}}.",
          "slots": {
            "ritual": {
              "options": [
                "staring at the wall",
                "talking to my plants",
                "checking my horoscope",
                "doom-scrolling",
                "a power pose"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_18",
          "text": "I keep trying to quit {{habit}}, but every Monday I start again.",
          "slots": {
            "habit": {
              "options": [
                "sugar",
                "doom-scrolling",
                "online shopping",
                "biting my nails",
                "my side hustle"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_19",
          "text": "This phase has lasted months: I cannot stop {{phase}}.",
          "slots": {
            "phase": {
              "options": [
                "buying Crocs",
                "doing finger guns",
                "humming the same song",
                "saying \"yeet\"",
                "winking at strangers"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "awkward_20",
          "text": "I go out for milk and keep coming home with {{haul}}.",
          "slots": {
            "haul": {
              "options": [
                "a canoe",
                "a goat",
                "another tattoo",
                "a timeshare in Spain",
                "three new houseplants"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
